- [x] Update the `3a — happy path` describe's first test ("returns ok with two-field config and all three body sections"). Rename to "returns ok with two-field config and all four body sections". Add an assertion `expect(result.studyPlaybook).toBe(extractCanonicalSection("studyPlaybook"))` between the playbook and research assertions. Add a content-substring assertion `expect(result.studyPlaybook).toMatch(/<some-distinctive-substring-from-the-canonical-fixture>/)` (mirroring the existing prose's `/Your brain is an external knowledge store/` assertion). The literal-`#`-headings test in the same describe should add comparable assertions for the study-playbook section's H1/H2 headings if the canonical fixture's study-playbook content includes them.
- [x] Update the `3e` describe's missing-pair parameterized cases. The current set has six cases (each of the three pairs missing alone, plus three pairs of two-pair-missing combinations). Add four NEW cases for the new section's coverage:
