  - "studyPlaybook closer present but opener missing" → expected reason `"unmatched closing marker: <!-- aide-study-playbook-end --> appeared without a prior <!-- aide-study-playbook-start -->"`

  These mirror the existing prose unmatched-opener and unmatched-closer tests that already live in `3e`. The implementor decides whether to add them as additional `it(...)` cases parallel to the existing prose ones, or to parameterize the unmatched-opener/closer tests over all four sections — either is fine; the playbook's testing note prefers parameterization when test bodies are identical.

